Package: networkprotection
Version: @DEBIAN_VERSION@
Section: net
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Maintainer: pthoelken <pthoelken@users.noreply.github.com>
Depends: bash, curl, gzip, ipset, iptables, python3, systemd, util-linux
Description: ipset-based network blocklists for Debian systems
 Network Protection maintains external IPv4, GeoIP, and Spamhaus ASN-DROP
 blocklists in dedicated ipsets. A local IPv4/IPv6 CIDR whitelist can bypass
 only the block rules managed by this package.
